    "title": "1 reportedly killed in I-65 crash after pursuit - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago JOHNSON COUNTY, Ind. — At least one person is dead in a crash after a reported police chase on Interstate 65 in Johnson County. According to an INDOT alert, the crash happened around 9:30 p.m. in the northbound lanes of I-65 near the 92-mile marker, between the Franklin and Whiteland exits. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
